{"title":"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27a79db58adaa5ede8cc761cfcb0465f8726f22a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"28\" height=\"24\" /> mean the number of whole number divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.  For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9dfc8f931da505cfd67e4c8dc260314ab7549d21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{3}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"23\" /> because 3 has two divisors, 1 and 3.  Find the value of\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e99d4be60abd970bb4dfbcb2c45c014f0ecc3be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\boxed{11}\\times\\boxed{20}}.\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80bd28708cfd1c2e8c2d707650650747f5f97cf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"358\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d9644cd2a0bf75d105cb03fa8db71b72aab5ca55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\boxed{11}\\times\\boxed{20}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"93\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factors, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/9/4191588c6547a3a066bd36bb4f24608b4eee4051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1, 2, 4, 5, 10, 20\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" /> as factors, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factors.  Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f274f5b86f0d5b20432b08478625ae215936f184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{11} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aef52b2d4b63d7d5f7373eeb78baa1bc80e743da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {20}= 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"65\" height=\"25\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/49715835d5b3416a0c63e95732b90fdfa4d6dc69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2 \\times 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"52\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/38693a75a9e00c962455566cda9d06d94da1738b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> has factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/9/4b9b1c1d9138eca2695a0e9a3d07dafa3f309f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 12\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81facc6e8ffbb834086d56f79b8337b9f020a9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{12} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME\" title=\"1997 AJHSME\">1997 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160